  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation and Valorization of Wadi Qadisha</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the framework of the management plan approved in December 2015 for the World Heritage Site of Wadi Qadisha , the project which aims to develop properly the cultural resources of the Qadisha valley ,has three components:
a-Social component: Improving mobility within the valley through rehabilitation of pedestrian paths .
b-Heritage component: Conservation and restoration of selected religious historic heritage structures .
c-Academic component: Training and workshops for the conservation and the restoration of cultural assets.</narrative>
  </description>
